{{C|Battle Hymn}} is a 1 {{Icon|PE}}-cost {{QueryLink|Cards|color:Purple|Watcher}} {{QueryLink|Cards|rarity:Uncommon|Uncommon}} {{QueryLink|Cards|type:Power|Power}} Card. It gives one {{BD|Battle Hymn}}, which adds one {{C|Smite}} to your hand at the start of every turn. When upgraded, it becomes {{KW|Innate}}, If this card is upgraded, it becomes {{KW|Innate}}, meaning it will always be in the first hand of combat.

== Interactions ==
=== Order ===
* {{BD|Battle Hymn}} takes effect before your cards are drawn. This means that having a high amount of {{BD|Battle Hymn}} can cause you to draw less cards at the start of your turn due to the hand size limit.

=== Synergies ===
* If you have played {{C|Master Reality}} before playing this card, it will add upgraded {{C|Smite|Smites}} to your hand instead.

=== Neutral ===
* If a {{C|Smite}} generated by this card exceeds your hand size limit, it gets added to the discard pile.

=== Anti-Synergies ===
* The constant addition of {{QueryLink|Cards|type:Attack|Attack}} cards to your hand will make it harder to play {{C|Signature Move}}.

