{{C|Chrysalis}} is a 2 {{Icon|CE}}-cost {{QueryLink|Cards|color:Colorless|Colorless}} {{QueryLink|Cards|rarity:Rare|Rare}} {{QueryLink|Cards|type:Skill|Skill}} Card. It shuffles 3 (5 if upgraded) random {{QueryLink|Cards|type:Skill|Skill}} cards into your draw pile, which will have their normal cost replaced by 0 for this combat, after which this {{C|Chrysalis}} {{KW|Exhaust|Exhausts}}. 

{{C|Chrysalis}} can only generate cards you can find in card rewards through character choice or custom run modifiers, and is not affected by {{R|Prismatic Shard}}. If you use the {{KW|Diverse}} or {{KW|Colorless Cards}} [[Custom Mode#Daily Modifiers|Modifier]], this card has a chance to generate itself, meaning you can theorethically keep generating {{QueryLink|Cards|type:Skill|Skill}} cards infinitely using this card. 

== Obtaining Chrysalis ==
{{C|Chrysalis}} is a {{QueryLink|Cards|color:Colorless|Colorless}} card, and therefore can be obtained in the following ways:
* Can be bought from the [[Merchant]].
* Can appear in the {{E|Sensory Stone}} event, from a choice of 3-9 {{QueryLink|Cards|color:Colorless|Colorless}} cards, depending on the option that is selected.
* Can be obtained from [[Monsters]], [[Elites]] and [[Bosses]] with {{R|Prismatic Shard}}.
** Also found in the [[Custom Mode|Daily Climb]] with the {{KW|Diverse}} or {{KW|Colorless Cards}} modifiers.
* Can be obtained from Neow's [[Third Blessing]] in exchange for a negative effect.

== Interactions ==
=== Neutral ===
* The randomization of {{BD|Confused}} or {{P|Snecko Oil}} will override the cost of the cards generated by this card.
* Some {{QueryLink|Cards|type:Skill|Skill}} cards cannot be generated, as they have some permanent effect out of combat, or can only be obtained from another source.
