* {{C|Battle Hymn}} and {{C|Study}} will generate a card every turn.
* {{C|Alpha}}, which will generate {{C|Beta}}, which will in turn generate {{C|Omega}}.
* {{C|Discovery}}, {{C|Jack of All Trades}}, {{C|Chrysalis}}, {{C|Magnetism}}, {{C|Metamorphosis}}, {{C|Transmutation}}.

* {{C|Anger}}, {{C|Dual Wield}} and {{C|Infernal Blade}}. 
* {{C|Blade Dance}}, {{C|Cloak and Dagger}}, {{C|Distraction}}, {{C|Endless Agony}}, {{C|Infinite Blades}}, {{C|Nightmare}}, {{C|Storm of Steel}}.
* {{C|Hello World}}, {{C|White Noise}}, {{C|Creative AI}}.

==== Relics ====
* {{R|Dead Branch}}
* {{R|Nilry's Codex}}

==== c) Potions ====
* {{P|Attack Potion}}
* {{P|Colorless Potion}}
* {{P|Power Potion}}
* {{P|Skill Potion}}
* {{P|Bottled Miracle}}

=== Neutral ===
* Only cards created after playing {{C|Master Reality}} will be {{KW|Upgrade|Upgraded}}.

* Although {{C|Burn}} has an upgraded version, it cannot be upgraded by the player, and is therefore unaffected by {{C|Master Reality}}.

* The {{BD|Master Reality}} buff does not stack, meaning {{C|Searing Blow}} can usually only be {{KW|Upgrade|Upgraded}} once.

* While {{C|Master Reality}} is active, {{C|Exhume}} will '''not''' upgrade the card it brings back.

== Bugs ==
* Under the effect of {{C|Master Reality}}, {{C|Dual Wield}} {{KW|Upgrade|Upgrades}} '''all''' cards, even the original card that was copied.

* If {{C|Searing Blow}} is generated with {{BD|Master Reality}} active, it will generate with +2 {{KW|Upgrade|Upgrades}} instead of +1, unless generated by {{C|Foreign Influence}} or {{R|Nilry's Codex}}. 
** This can be replicated without {{R|Prismatic Shard}} or {{E|A Note For Yourself}}, by generating {{C|Searing Blow}} with {{C|Foreign Influence}} as [[The Watcher]] in the [[Bronze Automaton]] combat. Allowing one of its minions to steal {{C|Searing Blow}} and then retrieving it by killing that minion counts as that {{C|Searing Blow}} being generated.
*** This can be used to achieve a maximum of +5 {{KW|Upgrade|Upgrades}}: +1 through initial generation via {{C|Foreign Influence}}, and +2 through both minions.

