== Obtaining Sadistic Nature ==
{{C|Sadistic Nature}} is a {{QueryLink|Cards|color:Colorless|Colorless}} card, and therefore can be obtained in the following ways:
* Can be bought from the [[Merchant]].
* Can appear in the {{E|Sensory Stone}} event, from a choice of 3-9 {{QueryLink|Cards|color:Colorless|Colorless}} cards, depending on the option that is selected.
* Can be obtained from [[Monsters]], [[Elites]] and [[Bosses]] with {{R|Prismatic Shard}}.
** Also found in the [[Custom Mode|Daily Climb]] with the {{KW|Diverse}} or {{KW|Colorless Cards}} modifiers.
* Can be obtained from Neow's [[Third Blessing]] in exchange for a negative effect.

== Interactions ==
=== Synergies ===
{{BD|Sadistic}} deals damage each time a [[Debuff]] is applied to an enemy.
* If a single source applies multiple debuffs (for example {{C|Uppercut}}), each unique debuff will trigger {{BD|Sadistic}} once.
* If a single source applies a debuff multiple times (for example {{C|Bouncing Flask}}), {{BD|Sadistic}} will trigger each time.

==== Ironclad ====
* Triggers {{BD|Sadistic}} multiple times: {{C|Uppercut}}, {{C|Shockwave}}
* {{C|Bash}}, {{C|Clothesline}}, {{C|Thunderclap}}, {{C|Disarm}}, {{C|Intimidate}}
* {{R|Champion Belt}}

==== Silent ====
* Triggers {{BD|Sadistic}} multiple times: {{C|Bouncing Flask}}, {{C|Crippling Cloud}}, {{C|Noxious Fumes}}, {{C|Corpse Explosion}}, {{C|Envenom}}, {{C|Malaise}}
* {{C|Neutralize}}, {{C|Deadly Poison}}, {{C|Piercing Wail}}, {{C|Poisoned Stab}}, {{C|Sucker Punch}}, {{C|Catalyst}}, {{C|Choke}}, {{C|Leg Sweep}}, {{C|Terror}}
* {{R|The Specimen}}
* {{P|Poison Potion}}

==== Defect ====
* {{C|Beam Cell}}, {{C|Go for the Eyes}}, {{C|Bullseye}}

==== Watcher ====
* Triggers {{BD|Sadistic}} multiple times: {{C|Wave of the Hand}}
* {{C|Crush Joints}}, {{C|Pressure Points}}, {{C|Sash Whip}}, {{C|Indignation}}, {{C|Talk to the Hand}}

==== All characters ====
* {{C|Blind}}, {{C|Dark Shackles}}, {{C|Trip}}
* {{R|Hand Drill}}
* {{P|Fear Potion}}, {{P|Weak Potion}}

=== Neutral ===
==== Snecko Skull ====
Although {{R|Snecko Skull}} increases the amount of {{BD|Poison}} applied, it does not activate Sadistic an extra time.

==== Strength ====
Is completely unaffected by {{BD|Strength}}. This means the debuff from {{M|Spire Shield|Spire Shield's}} {{Int|Spire Shield|Bash}} will have no effect on it, but neither will {{R|Shuriken}}, {{R|Vajra}}, or {{C|Inflame}}.

==== Thorns and Flight ====
As Sadistic Nature does not do Attack damage, it bypasses {{M|Spiker|Spikers'}} {{BD|Thorns}} and {{M|Byrd|Byrds'}} {{BD|Flying}}, but it also does not benefit from {{M|Giant Head|Giant Head's}} {{BD|Slow}}.

==== Stances ====
Similarly, the damage from Sadistic Nature is not affected by being in {{KW|Wrath}} or {{KW|Divinity}}.

