== Interactions ==
=== Order ===
{{BD|The Bomb}} activates before the enemy turn. On top of happening before enemy intents, it will also activate before:
* Before {{BD|Invincible}} resets
* Before {{BD|Poison}} activates

When alongside other [[Buffs]] or [[Debuffs]] which activate at the end of the player's turn, {{BD|The Bomb}} activates in the order the buffs were gained. This includes:
* {{BD|Regen}}
* {{BD|Constricted}}
* {{BD|Combust}}
* {{BD|Omega}}

=== Neutral ===
* This damage is not affected by {{BD|Vulnerable}}, {{BD|Strength}}, or {{BD|Double Damage}}.

