{{C|Thinking Ahead}} is a {{QueryLink|Cards|color:Colorless|Colorless}} card, and therefore can be obtained in the following ways:
* Can be bought from the [[Merchant]].
* Can appear in the {{E|Sensory Stone}} event, from a choice of 3-9 {{QueryLink|Cards|color:Colorless|Colorless}} cards, depending on the option that is selected.
* Can be obtained from [[Monsters]], [[Elites]] and [[Bosses]] with {{R|Prismatic Shard}}.
** Also found in the [[Custom Mode|Daily Climb]] with the {{KW|Diverse}} or {{KW|Colorless Cards}} modifiers.
* Can be obtained from Neow's [[Third Blessing]] in exchange for a negative effect.

== Interactions ==
=== Order ===
* Selecting the card to put on top of your draw pile happens ''after'' drawing, meaning a card drawn this way can potentially be placed right back on top.

* Although {{C|Mayhem}} plays the top card of the draw pile, it cannot be used in tandem with {{C|Thinking Ahead}} to play a specific card, as {{C|Mayhem}} activates after cards are drawn at the start of your turn, meaning the card will already be in hand.

