== Obtaining Transmutation ==
{{C|Transmutation}} is a {{QueryLink|Cards|color:Colorless|Colorless}} card, and therefore can be obtained in the following ways:
* Can be bought from the [[Merchant]].
* Can appear in the {{E|Sensory Stone}} event, from a choice of 3-9 {{QueryLink|Cards|color:Colorless|Colorless}} cards, depending on the option that is selected.
* Can be obtained from [[Monsters]], [[Elites]] and [[Bosses]] with {{R|Prismatic Shard}}.
** Also found in the [[Custom Mode|Daily Climb]] with the {{KW|Diverse}} or {{KW|Colorless Cards}} modifiers.
* Can be obtained from Neow's [[Third Blessing]] in exchange for a negative effect.

== Interactions ==
=== Synergies ===
* {{R|Chemical X}} makes {{C|Transmutation}} apply 2 more times, regardless of the amount of {{Icon|CE}} '''Energy''' used to play it.
* If played using {{P|Distilled Chaos}}, {{C|Havoc}}, or {{C|Omniscience}}, it will play for the full current {{Icon|CE}} '''Energy''' without actually using any.
* Can be used with 0 {{Icon|CE}} '''Energy''' to advance {{R|Ink Bottle}} or {{R|Letter Opener}}.

=== Neutral ===
* If a card generated by this card exceeds your hand size limit, it gets added to the discard pile.
* If {{C|Transmutation}} is duplicated with an effect such as a {{P|Duplication Potion}} or {{C|Burst}}, the value of '''X''' will also be used for the copy.
* Being an X-cost, {{C|Transmutation}} can be {{C|Recycle|Recycled}} to double the current {{Icon|CE}} '''Energy'''.
* It will not count as a 0-cost card for {{C|Scrape}} or {{C|All for One}}.

* Some {{QueryLink|Cards|color:Colorless|Colorless}} cards cannot be generated, as they have some permanent effect out of combat, or can only be obtained from another source.
